            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-lobo-limbform-morphology-measurement-segments-491-wild-type-right-leg-i-huntsman-spider>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-lobo-limbform-morphology-measurement-silhouette-iou-vs-fig-1-a-1-wild-type-right-forelimb>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-lobo-limbform-morphology-measurement-silhouette-iou-vs-fig-1-b-280-wild-type-right-hindlimb>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-lobo-limbform-morphology-measurement-silhouette-iou-vs-fig-1-c-314-wild-type-right-walking-leg-fiddler-crab>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-lobo-limbform-morphology-measurement-silhouette-iou-vs-fig-1-d-490-wild-type-right-metathoracic-t3-leg-cricket-nymph>,
